==English==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|un|just}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʌnˈʤʌst/}}
* {{audio|en-us-unjust.ogg|Audio (US)}}
:* {{rhymes|ʌst}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not [[fair]], [[just]] or [[right]].
#: ''The solution was very '''unjust'''.''

====Synonyms====
* [[unfair]]

====Antonyms====
* [[just]]

====Related terms====
* [[justice]]
* [[injustice]]

=====Usage notes=====
Beware that '''unjust''' and {{term|injustice|lang=en}} use different prefixes – *''injust'' and *''unjustice'' are incorrect.

